Indeed $|a_z-t_z|+|b_z-t_z|=|a_z-b_z|+2\operatorname{dist}(t_z,[\min(a_z,b_z),\max(a_z,b_z)])$ for each coordinate; summing and dividing by four proves (11.15). Applying the chains yields, throughout $I_0$,

